		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]博士『必ず
歴史を　変えてやるぞ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-11-27T12:10:22" />
